# Append to the file named by `acl_file` in your mosquitto.conf, then `sudo systemctl reload mosquitto`.
# The gateway's own user: state/diag/visits/availability and the command topics under catlink/litterbox,
# plus write-only access to its retained discovery configs. Adjust if you changed CATLINK_BASE,
# CATLINK_DISCOVERY_PREFIX or CATLINK_NODE.

user catlink
topic readwrite catlink/litterbox/#
topic write homeassistant/+/catlink_litterbox/#

# Home Assistant's own user must be able to read catlink/litterbox/# and homeassistant/#, and to write
# catlink/litterbox/+/set (commands). A typical HA user already has this, e.g.:
#   user homeassistant
#   topic readwrite #
